              "key": "visit_section_6_text_24",
              "label": "Text: Yes. Let us know when you plan your visit, or call 304-587-4709, and w",
              "type": "text",
              "def": "Yes. Let us know when you plan your visit, or call 304-587-4709, and we will do our best to have everything ready for you."
